      "name": "dsh-plugin-subagent-bridge",
      "title": {
        "en": "Subagent Bridge",
        "zh": "子智能体桥"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Subagent-shaped bridge between Codex and DeepSeek Harness: Codex spawns DSH workers over a loopback MCP endpoint, waits for final answers, follows up, and can pin the model each worker runs on; DSH agents can dispatch to Codex in return.",
        "zh": "让 Codex 通过本机 MCP 把 DSH 当 subagent 用：派发任务、并行开 worker、等待结果、继续对话，可按次指定 worker 使用的模型；反向也能把任务派给 Codex。"
      },
