        "en": "Usage Panel",
        "zh": "用量面板"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Shows how much of each provider quota window is left as a chip beside the model selector, with a detail popover: GLM Coding Plan (5-hour / weekly / tool calls) and OpenCode Zen (rolling / weekly / monthly), picked from the provider the session is actually running.",
        "zh": "在模型选择器旁显示供应商套餐的额度余量，点开是明细浮层：GLM Coding Plan（5 小时 / 每周 / 工具调用）和 OpenCode Zen（滚动 / 每周 / 每月），按会话实际使用的供应商自动切换。"
      },
